The '''Turkey Gamepass''' is a [[Gamepasses|gamepass]] that was introduced by [[Nikilis]] on November 21st, 2023 during the [[Thanksgiving Event 2023]]. It was purchasable for 1,699 Robux and contained the [[Godly Weapons|godly]] knife [[Turkey]]. The item inside is now only obtainable through [[trading]] as the gamepass has since gone offsale.

== Description ==
Below is the description of the gamepass found on Roblox:

<nowiki>=== Available for a LIMITED TIME! ===</nowiki> 

+ Exclusive "Turkey" GODLY knife! 

Yes, you're literally using a turkey leg as a weapon.

[ WARNING: Do not delete the game-pass. You can purchase a second copy of the knife in the in-game shop.]

== Trivia ==
*The link to the gamepass can be found [https://www.roblox.com/game-pass/658667213/GODLY-Turkey here].

